[I] Optimized integer division library

[T] libdivide is a header-only library for optimized integer division, replacing
[T] expensive divisions by a runtime constant with multiplications and shifts,
[T] used by the rocroller of hipblaslt.

[U] https://libdivide.com/

[A] ridiculous_fish
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/development
